<section class="section" id="reviews" style="background:var(--color-primary-light);padding:var(--space-4xl) 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title text-center">
      <h2>Loved by Crocheters</h2>
      <p>Join thousands of makers who have created their own Solea Cardigan</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top:3rem;">
      <div class="card card--glass">
        <div class="card__body">
          <div class="star-rating" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
          <p style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.95rem;">"This pattern is incredibly well written! The video tutorial made the shell stitches so easy to understand. I've already made two!"</p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;font-weight:600;font-size:0.875rem;">— Sarah M.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--glass">
        <div class="card__body">
          <div class="star-rating" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
          <p style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.95rem;">"As a plus-size crocheter, I appreciate the inclusive sizing so much. The 3X fit me perfectly with beautiful drape."</p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;font-weight:600;font-size:0.875rem;">— Jennifer T.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--glass">
        <div class="card__body">
          <div class="star-rating" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
          <p style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.95rem;">"The seamless construction is a dream. No sewing at the end! Highly recommend this to any intermediate crocheter."</p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;font-weight:600;font-size:0.875rem;">— Amanda K.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

